            <title>[BOOKKEEPER-298] We run with preferIPv4Stack in the scripts but not in the tests</title>
                <link>https://issues.apache.org/jira/browse/BOOKKEEPER-298</link>
                <project id="12311293" key="BOOKKEEPER">Bookkeeper</project>
                    <description>&lt;p&gt;Bookkeeper doesn&apos;t work with IPv6, but if it&apos;s enabled, java will try to use it. We get around this by setting the java.net.preferIPv4Stack in the startup scripts but we don&apos;t set it for the tests.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
